{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"对称幺半范畴"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"对称幺半范畴"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对称幺半范畴是 $(\\mathsf{Cat},\\times)$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"交换代数","text":"交换代数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"对称幺半 $\\infty$-范畴"}},{"Plain":"也可等价地定义为 "},{"Local":{"url":"E∞-空间","text":"$\\mathbb E_\\infty$-生象"}},{"Plain":"范畴 $\\mathsf{CAlg}(\\mathsf{Ani})$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴对象","text":"范畴对象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>严格化</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半范畴的严格化","text":"严格化"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>PROP</h3>\n<p>有一类对称幺半范畴范畴常作为"},{"Local":{"url":"代数理论","text":"代数结构"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"语法范畴","text":"语法范畴"}},{"Plain":", 称为 <strong></strong>"},{"Local":{"url":"PROP","text":"PROP"}},{"Plain":" (意为 products &amp; permutations), 它是指所有对象均形如 $x^{\\otimes n}$ 的对称幺半范畴.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Lawvere理论","text":"Lawvere 理论"}},{"Plain":"是 PROP 的特殊情形: 它的运算 $\\otimes$ 是范畴论"},{"Local":{"url":"积(范畴论)","text":"积"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>PROP 又可视为单色"},{"Local":{"url":"算畴","text":"算畴"}},{"Plain":": 对于 PROP $\\mathcal P$, $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P}(x^{\\otimes n},x)$ 构成一个单色算畴的 $n$-元运算.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"积幺半范畴","text":"积幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"对称幺半 ∞-范畴"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}